<title>GERMANY: Bosch 1996 net profit 500 mln DM.</title>
<headline>Bosch 1996 net profit 500 mln DM.</headline>
<dateline>GERLINGEN, Germany 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar year 1996:</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   500     vs 550</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    1,673   vs 1,646</p>
<p>    Group sales				  41,100  up 14.8 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - German electronics company Robert Bosch GmbH said its sales this year would rise to about 45 billion marks. Sales in the first four months of the year were 14.8 billion marks, with growth primarily outside Germany.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
